WEBVTT

00:00:54.670 --> 00:00:59.780
Austin and welcome to yoga essentials yoga is a wonderful

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:07.920
way to improve your quality of life the word yoga means union it is the joining of the mind and body

00:01:08.160 --> 00:01:16.760
yoga is made up of a series of poses called asanas for this program i've selected a group of poses

00:01:16.760 --> 00:01:24.450
that can be learned by people of all ages and fitness levels yoga essentials will teach you

00:01:24.450 --> 00:01:29.970
an effective, natural way to improve your flexibility, your strength and balance.

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:37.050
By doing the postures, you'll lengthen and strengthen the spine, your body's lifeline.

00:01:37.350 --> 00:01:40.170
We'll condition the body without punishing it.

00:01:40.650 --> 00:01:50.210
Besides all of the wonderful physical benefits from yoga, it will have a tremendous calming effect in the way that you cope with everyday stress.

00:01:50.680 --> 00:01:57.540
You'll find that after a short period of regular practice, your overall health and vitality will improve.

00:01:57.920 --> 00:01:59.880
You'll feel supple yet strong.

00:02:00.510 --> 00:02:05.010
You'll feel energized, yet relaxed, light and full of energy.

00:02:06.160 --> 00:02:09.840
Yoga works the body differently than any other forms of exercise.

00:02:10.360 --> 00:02:16.140
With yoga, you work slowly and deliberately, always being very mindful of the breath.

00:02:16.530 --> 00:02:23.950
You'll become more aware of the importance of proper breathing in the development of strength and quieting of the mind.

00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:29.480
Now remember, it takes time to perfect all the yoga poses.

00:02:30.280 --> 00:02:37.120
So listen to your body, be patient with yourself, and remember, always do the best that you

00:02:37.120 --> 00:02:37.560
can do.

00:02:38.670 --> 00:02:45.930
This tape is divided into four workout segments, sun salutations, standing postures, floor

00:02:45.930 --> 00:02:48.910
postures, and a final relaxation routine.

00:02:49.410 --> 00:02:54.530
I'll take you to one of my favorite places to do yoga, Utah's Snow Canyon.

00:02:55.420 --> 00:02:59.980
With sun salutations, you can begin each new day with a

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:07.080
attitude of renewal. It's a wonderful way to unwind. Standing postures will

00:03:07.080 --> 00:03:12.780
improve your balance and flexibility. It will increase your energy and build

00:03:12.780 --> 00:03:19.770
stamina. Floor postures will elongate and align the back, stretch the hamstrings

00:03:19.770 --> 00:03:26.340
and soothe the nervous system. The relaxation segment of four will help you

00:03:26.340 --> 00:03:29.840
release tension and establish total stillness.

00:03:30.160 --> 00:03:38.150
in body and mind you can use it anytime you feel tense or stressed the beauty of this tape is that

00:03:38.150 --> 00:03:44.150
you could do all four segments together or you can combine any of the segments it's all up to you

00:03:44.200 --> 00:03:49.960
what i like to do is use my remote control and if i only have time for one segment i'll just do that

00:03:50.650 --> 00:03:57.150
before starting watch this tape through from beginning to end at least once that way you'll

00:03:57.150 --> 00:03:59.210
get very comfortable with each segment.

00:04:00.060 --> 00:04:06.520
When you're ready to start, choose a warm, well-ventilated space, free from any disturbances.

00:04:06.720 --> 00:04:08.720
I even unplug my telephone.

00:04:09.470 --> 00:04:11.190
Work with your bare feet.

00:04:11.450 --> 00:04:15.490
Wear comfortable clothing, and don't exercise on a full stomach.

00:04:15.870 --> 00:04:18.150
Wait about two hours after a meal.

00:04:18.870 --> 00:04:20.490
Now, here's what you'll need.

00:04:20.840 --> 00:04:28.210
A pillow, a blanket or a mat, a towel or a strap, and possibly a chair for extra assistance.

00:04:32.490 --> 00:04:34.630
Here's a few essential tips on yoga.

00:04:35.290 --> 00:04:36.630
First, a little about balance.

00:04:36.930 --> 00:04:39.530
The key to balancing is concentration.

00:04:40.010 --> 00:04:43.110
Find a spot on the wall and focus gently.

00:04:43.860 --> 00:04:49.480
You must keep the focus and the concentration very soft, never rigid or hard.

00:04:49.860 --> 00:04:52.740
Remember that the nature of balance is fluid.

00:04:53.920 --> 00:04:59.900
Any time you have an inner or an outer change or distraction, it is going to affect your balance.

00:05:00.030 --> 00:05:07.080
Keep the gaze of your eyes very steady, your breathing soft, and never hold your breath.

00:05:07.940 --> 00:05:11.520
Keep a well-grounded, broad base in the supporting foot.

00:05:11.840 --> 00:05:17.410
It takes time to develop coordination to stay balanced, so be patient with yourself.

00:05:17.670 --> 00:05:20.630
You may want to use a chair or a wall in the very beginning.

00:05:22.080 --> 00:05:23.260
A little about breathing.

00:05:24.300 --> 00:05:28.360
In yoga, the breath is the link between the body and the mind.

00:05:28.960 --> 00:05:29.540
Therefore,

00:05:30.030 --> 00:05:34.110
Awareness of the breath is essential to doing the yoga postures correctly.

00:05:35.050 --> 00:05:40.850
Now, the easiest way for me to explain the proper breath is to visualize a baby sleeping in its crib.

00:05:41.170 --> 00:05:47.650
We have all seen how their little tummies expand with the inhale and gently contract with the exhale.

00:05:48.550 --> 00:05:53.000
Likewise, in yoga, breathing is full, deep, and smooth.

00:05:53.600 --> 00:05:54.680
Let's give this a try.

00:05:55.140 --> 00:05:57.020
Place your hands on your abdomen.

00:05:57.640 --> 00:05:59.120
Now, as you inhale.

00:06:00.700 --> 00:06:05.900
Feel your stomach expanding as if it were a balloon, filling up with the air.

00:06:06.100 --> 00:06:13.050
Now, as you exhale, gently compress the abdomen in, deflating the balloon.

00:06:13.880 --> 00:06:16.420
Become aware of your body as you do with this.

00:06:17.000 --> 00:06:20.400
Try this not tensing up the shoulders or the back.

00:06:20.620 --> 00:06:23.280
